{
    "word": "machiavellianism",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                "word": "Machiavellianism",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dc2a2f54-c322-487c-b22a-fe3c6ebbf911",
                        "entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Machiavellianisms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f01e8089-2fe3-360c-b446-333c0d932466",
                        "entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The political philosophy of Machiavelli, especially the realist doctrine which emphasizes the maintenance of the state above ethical concerns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b6a3037-920f-4f97-bbce-497d25d85902",
                                "sense_id": "f01e8089-2fe3-360c-b446-333c0d932466",
                                "text": "\"Machiavellianism is a radical type of political realism that is applied to both domestic and international affairs.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be2e1bf6-2860-4a2d-9d17-a06f18b9f5bf",
                                "sense_id": "f01e8089-2fe3-360c-b446-333c0d932466",
                                "text": "Let us turn, finally, to the war itself, and ask ourselves if it can be understood as the victory of decency over Machiavellianism."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "535e22c3-c872-3d5c-989f-68dc4382aa62",
                        "entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A political maneuver that exemplifies the philosophy. Unsavory government politics."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23fa69aa-309a-384f-a36d-48cf605cfe08",
                        "entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A psychological construct centered on interpersonal manipulation, lack of empathy, cold affect, and indifference to morality."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4d4a5f2-1ecf-4c3f-8ec5-8cc9ab2bdbbf",
                                "sense_id": "23fa69aa-309a-384f-a36d-48cf605cfe08",
                                "text": "Machiavellianism refers to interpersonal strategies that advocate self-interest, deception, and manipulation, so it would seem inherently related to core psychopathy and narcissism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f169b8e-cb5a-493e-92f9-2a00bfa5fb08",
                                "sense_id": "23fa69aa-309a-384f-a36d-48cf605cfe08",
                                "text": "A cluster of dark personality traits named the “dark tetrad” (psychopathy, narcissism, Machiavellianism, sadism) has attracted the interest of researchers studying personality and decision making."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a9e1022-3650-409d-9d86-9becccf1c182",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "source_sense_description": "philosophy",
                        "target_lang_word": "machiavelismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "machiavelismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9d85191-f533-35ff-ad4e-59a9daa376a7",
                                        "entry_id": "b78c1844-93f5-32a4-84d7-d7109486557b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "pragmatické a cynické jednání bez ohledu na morální kritéria, podle hesla „účel světí prostředky“, zvláště v politice"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e52af54-f079-4e55-9219-5e394f370cde",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d2d5e7d-94d0-3282-bf1d-f680f15b90ae",
                        "source_sense_description": "philosophy",
                        "target_lang_word": "machiavélisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "machiavélisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09e9078e-a801-329d-836b-047342a6f5ce",
                                        "entry_id": "54dca99e-21a7-3cec-9a25-ed8e63e94a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Système politique de Nicolas Machiavel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4e44b09-fa4c-313c-9bd4-e8afdb2059fc",
                                        "entry_id": "54dca99e-21a7-3cec-9a25-ed8e63e94a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Principes et actions où il entre de la mauvaise foi, de la perfidie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8201830-08e1-4fa0-824f-d19a79420f5f",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e44b09-fa4c-313c-9bd4-e8afdb2059fc",
                                                "text": "À première vue, il semble bien chimérique de croire à un tel machiavélisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bd37334-5df7-4507-a5dc-fd7eb91eac11",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e44b09-fa4c-313c-9bd4-e8afdb2059fc",
                                                "text": "Toutes les ruses, il les imagine et les déploie avec un machiavélisme qui parfois lui pèse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e34d9d50-6745-4533-8e0a-c8c6428bd884",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e44b09-fa4c-313c-9bd4-e8afdb2059fc",
                                                "text": "Mais personne n’ose dire que le facteur central de l’histoire des années 1920-1939 fut purement et simplement l’incompétence technique des classes dirigeantes et des gouvernements occidentaux. Leurs opposants préfèrent croire au machiavélisme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b209300-0480-4d29-9181-0b4a06ef1e57",
